@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> R1 : [create new account]

state R1 <<choice>>
state R2 <<choice>>
state R3 <<choice>>

R1 --> R2 : [validate registration]
R2 --> R3 : [log in upon successful registration]

state R3 <<choice>>
state R4 <<choice>>
state R5 <<choice>>
state R6 <<choice>>
state R7 <<choice>>

R3 --> R4 : [check ticket status]
R4 --> R5 : [book a ticket]
R5 --> R6 : [confirm payment]
R6 --> R7 : [manage account details]

R7 --> [*] : [log out after any action]

@enduml
